title: "Benign by Script: audit code for the 5G-NIDD intrusion dataset"
abstract: >-
  Code and summary results for an audit of the 5G-NIDD intrusion detection
  dataset: a block of 281,529 mislabelled UDP flood flows, identity-shortcut
  columns, corrected dataset versions, and an evaluation of label-error audit
  procedures.
